库收货是必要环节，但收货本身不等于退款成功，最终以对账成功为准。资格通过也不代表已批准退款。\",\"needs_input\":false,\"citations\":[\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-REFUND-01\",\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-01\"],\"facts\":[{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"standard_return_window_seconds\",\"value\":604800},{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"all_refunds_require_review\",\"value\":true},{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"evaluated_at\",\"value\":\"2026-10-11T02:00:00Z\"}]}"}}, {"step": "2", "result": {"calls": [], "model": "deepseek-flash", "usage": {"total_tokens": 2645, "prompt_tokens": 2379, "completion_tokens": 266, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 1792, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 587}, "content": "{\"answer\":\"按政策（POLICY-A-2026-10-v1）：常规退货需先获得批准，批准后还要等待仓库确认收货；只有模拟支付对账成功，才能报告模拟退款成功。也就是说，仓库收货是常规退货退款流程中的必要环节，收货并审核通过、对账成功后才会显示退款成功。资格通过不等于批准退款，退款也需审核。\",\"needs_input\":false,\"citations\":[\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-REFUND-01\",\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-01\",\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-02\"],\"facts\":[{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"standard_return_window_seconds\",\"value\":604800},{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"all_refunds_require_review\",\"value\":true},{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"evaluated_at\",\"value\":\"2026-10-11T02:00:00Z\"}]}"}}], "tokens": {"total_tokens": 9815, "prompt_tokens": 9217, "completion_tokens": 598, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 8192, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1025}, "extra": {}, "run_status": "FAILED", "error_code": "UNVERIFIED_STATUS_CLAIM", "runs": [{"processed": true, "run_id": "RUN-14773ED74361488C9375EB3751F90CC0", "conversation_id": "CONV-85EAA5AE77914291A458BA133DBFDB83", "status": "FAILED", "action": "CONSULT", "target_order_id": null, "provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-flash", "prompt_version": "